This product includes models and data from third parties:

Qwen3-1.7B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B), by the Qwen team, Apache-2.0.
  The published model is a LoRA fine-tune of Qwen3-1.7B, merged and quantized to GGUF.

Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507), by the Qwen team, Apache-2.0.
  Teacher for 422 of the 782 training conversations (data/teacher-v1..v3, generated locally, filtered and reviewed).

Claude (claude-opus-5-5), by Anthropic.
  Wrote the other 360 training conversations (configs/authored_v1.jsonl, v2, v3, v5) in Claude Code sessions,
  and served as the blind evaluation scorers (evidence/). No external conversation dataset was used.

llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT. Used to convert, quantize and serve the model;
  not included in the Python package.
